  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would mainly like to be able to animate and move my viewpoint.\n I've seen many avatars that have features such as taking off their head, or becoming larger, or even spawning in a massive robot. \nMe and quite a few others would like the ability to move our viewpoint, I'm aware that it is bound to the humanoid rig of an avatar, so why not make it so we can bind it to any bone we'd like?\nOr even being able to animate Eye Look, or LipSync, lets say you've powered up and need to show off even more power by changing visemes. Or switching to your second pair of eyes without only using constraints.\nI feel too stiff in some of my own avatars and I'd love for more customization of what I can do.",
